      "writtenOn": "2018-03-02T16:14:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Technically the challenge can have embedded whitespace, and we print it that way.  If someone copy/pastes it in, the length might not match.  If there are the wrong number of non-whitespace chars, base32_decode will fail.",
